{"id":"e3f2b845-8f2c-4b5a-9caf-eac1029d3e7e","revision":0,"last_node_id":140,"last_link_id":283,"nodes":[{"id":92,"type":"SaveVideo","pos":[1660,4850],"size":[1210,106],"flags":{},"order":17,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"视频","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","link":260},{"localized_name":"文件名前缀","name":"filename_prefix","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"filename_prefix"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"格式","name":"format","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"format"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"编码器","name":"codec","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"codec"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"VIDEO","links":null}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.30.0","Node name for S\u0026R":"SaveVideo","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["video/MiniMax_H3","auto","auto"]},{"id":116,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-2600,4830],"size":[520,860],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"SF-H3 导演台使用说明","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## SF-H3 双模式导演台\n\n1. 顶部使用“宫格模式 / 全能参考”按钮切换，两种模式的素材互不串用。\n2. 宫格模式：选择四、六或九宫格图片，设置宫格格式与白边裁剪强度，再连接宫格分镜文本。\n3. 全能参考：使用导演台的“＋图片 / ＋视频 / ＋音频”按钮，或连接对应参考接口。\n4. 两种模式切换时会保留各自的时间线内容，切回后可以继续编辑。\n5. 导演台统一控制时长、比例、提示词、条件和音视频潜空间。\n6. 采样完成后，视频 VAE 与音频 VAE 分别解码，再由“创建视频”合成为带声音的视频。\n\n### H3 参考限制\n\n- 最多 9 张图片、3 段视频、3 段音频。\n- 单段视频或音频为 2 至 15 秒。\n- 参考视频总时长不超过 15 秒，参考音频总时长不超过 15 秒。\n- 音频不能作为唯一参考。\n- H3 固定使用 24 帧/秒。\n\n安装或更新导演台后需要完全重启 ComfyUI。"],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":117,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-2600,5750],"size":[440,740],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"Note: Model Links","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## Model Links\n[🤗 Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3)\n